    <dashboard name='Story 1' type='storyboard'>
      <style>
        <style-rule element='story-point-caption'>
          <format attr='width' value='584' />
        </style-rule>
      </style>
      <size maxheight='800' maxwidth='1200' minheight='800' minwidth='1200' sizing-mode='fixed' />
      <zones>
        <zone h='100000' id='2' type-v2='layout-basic' w='100000' x='0' y='0'>
          <zone h='98000' id='1' param='vert' removable='false' type-v2='layout-flow' w='98666' x='667' y='1000'>
            <zone h='4125' id='3' type-v2='title' w='98666' x='667' y='1000' />
            <zone h='12625' id='4' is-fixed='true' paired-zone-id='5' removable='false' type-v2='flipboard-nav' w='98666' x='667' y='5125' />
            <zone h='81250' id='5' paired-zone-id='4' removable='false' type-v2='flipboard' w='98666' x='667' y='17750'>
              <flipboard active-id='8' nav-type='caption' show-nav-arrows='true'>
                <story-points>
                  <story-point caption='A five-hospital network serving the Bagmati region — but performance varies sharply across sites.' captured-sheet='Dashboard 1 - Overview' id='1' />
                  <story-point caption='Critical-care beds run dangerously full, and every monsoon makes the strain worse.' captured-sheet='Dashboard 2 - Occupancy' id='2' />
                  <story-point caption='The sickest patients stay far longer than WHO targets — and one in four critical cases does not survive.' captured-sheet='Dashboard 3  - LOS &amp; Discharge' id='3' />
                  <story-point caption='Emergency waits reach 100 minutes against a 30-minute standard — the ER is the network&apos;s bottleneck.' captured-sheet='Dashboard 4 - ER &amp; Staffing' id='4' />
                  <story-point caption='Nearly half of all shifts run into overtime — the workforce is absorbing the system&apos;s strain.' captured-sheet='Dashboard 5 - Staffing &amp; ML Risk' id='5' />
                  <story-point caption='Predictive models flag at-risk patients before discharge — turning historical data into early warning.' captured-sheet='Dashboard 6 - ML Predictions' id='6' />
                  <story-point caption='Each model&apos;s logic stays transparent, showing exactly which factors drive its predictions' captured-sheet='Dashboard 7 - ML Feature Intelligence' id='7' />
                  <story-point caption='Four targeted interventions follow directly from the evidence.' captured-sheet='' id='8' />
                </story-points>
              </flipboard>
            </zone>
          </zone>
          <zone-style>
            <format attr='border-color' value='#000000' />
            <format attr='border-style' value='none' />
            <format attr='border-width' value='0' />
            <format attr='margin' value='8' />
          </zone-style>
        </zone>
        <zone flipboard-zone-id='5' forceUpdate='true' h='83000' id='6' story-point-id='8' type-v2='text' w='100417' x='-333' y='16750'>
          <formatted-text>
            <run fontalignment='0' fontname='Arial' fontsize='20'>1. Monsoon surge capacity — expand ICU, HDU, and ER beds ahead of June–September peak (D2).</run>
            <run fontalignment='0'>Æ&#10;&#10;</run>
            <run fontalignment='0' fontname='Arial' fontsize='20'>2. ER triage reform — fast-track critical cases to cut wait times from 100 min toward the 30-minute WHO standard (D4).</run>
            <run fontalignment='0'>Æ&#10;&#10;</run>
            <run fontalignment='0' fontname='Arial' fontsize='20'>3. Roster rebalancing — redistribute shifts to reduce the 49.6% overtime rate by at least half (D5).</run>
            <run fontalignment='0'>Æ&#10;&#10;</run>
            <run fontalignment='0' fontname='Arial' fontsize='20'>4. Discharge risk flags — pilot readmission and mortality prediction alerts at point of discharge (D6).</run>
            <run fontalignment='0'>Æ&#10;&#10;</run>
            <run fontalignment='0' fontname='Arial' fontsize='20'>Limitations: Occupancy and LOS estimates are reliable. Overtime and readmission models are decision-support tools only — not automation-ready.</run>
          </formatted-text>
        </zone>
      </zones>
      <simple-id uuid='{32B004A9-55F9-45B8-9AC2-2C504322D0E3}' />
    </dashboard>
  </dashboards>
